    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Regizorul filmelor \"Cel mai iubit dintre p\u0103m\u00e2nteni\", \"Tic\u0103lo\u0219ii\" sau \"Cei care pl\u0103tesc cu via\u021ba\" revine cu o nou\u0103 produc\u021bie despre Rom\u00e2nia actual\u0103, despre resemnare, speran\u021b\u0103 \u0219i haz de necaz. \u0218erban Marinescu a realizat o satir\u0103 la adresa societ\u0103\u021bii rom\u00e2ne\u0219ti, \u021besut\u0103 \u00een jurul unui profesor modest de limba francez\u0103, care toata via\u021ba a visat s\u0103 vad\u0103 Parisul. \u00centr-o \u021bar\u0103 a respectului pentru valoare, \u00een care lozinca \"La vremuri noi, tot noi!\" nu are fundament, unde politicienii au experien\u021ba vie\u021bii reale, iar pensionarii \u00een\u021beleg cu adev\u0103rat ce s-a c\u00e2\u0219tigat \u00een \u201989, \u00eentr-o \u021bar\u0103 \u00een care democra\u021bia este tr\u0103it\u0103 ca \u00een vest, cu poli\u021bia mereu la datorie \u0219i \u00een care speran\u021ba abia mai tr\u0103ie\u0219te, \"Doar cu buletinul la Paris\" vine s\u0103 \u00eent\u0103reasc\u0103 exact contrariul!!! Realitatea love\u0219te nemilos \u00een visul celui naiv, iar oamenii one\u0219ti constat\u0103 c\u0103 \"am ajuns la m\u00e2na mitocanilor\". Suntem nevoi\u021bi \u00eentotdeauna... \"s-o lu\u0103m de la cap\u0103t\"!",
        "english": "Professor Nitza is the good guy: soft-spoken and mild-mannered. Everyone in the movie gets license to treat him like a punching bag."
    },
